{"id":"2b89be05e707ab52","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-total-extender-dodd-data.md","title":"Total Extender Quotient and Dodd Generator Data","display":"df-total-extender-dodd-data — Total Extender Quotient and Dodd Generator Data","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-total-extender-dodd-data","aliases":["58-df-total-extender-dodd-data"],"display":"df-total-extender-dodd-data — Total Extender Quotient and Dodd Generator Data","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-class-quotient-collapse.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-total-extender-dodd-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-total-extender-dodd-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-total-extender-dodd-data — Total Extender Quotient and Dodd Generator Data"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c11b408c5a26a920\" href=\"?note=c11b408c5a26a920\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b1721f50aceb744e\" href=\"?note=b1721f50aceb744e\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-class-quotient-collapse.md\">../batch04/58-df-class-quotient-collapse.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5578254565969219\" href=\"?note=5578254565969219\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1d8adfba370086ed\" href=\"?note=1d8adfba370086ed\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md\">../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,\\kappa,\\lambda,a,b,f,g,t,\\tau,X,\\alpha\\in V\">\\(E,\\kappa,\\lambda,a,b,f,g,t,\\tau,X,\\alpha\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,j,\\pi\">\\(N,j,\\pi\\)</span> 为元语言类。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4Extender}_S(E,\\kappa,\\lambda)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4Extender}_S(E,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\)</span> 使用本书已给出的宇宙初等嵌入导出的短 extender。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\subseteq b\\in[\\lambda]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(a\\subseteq b\\in[\\lambda]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p^b_a:\\kappa^{|b|}\\to\\kappa^{|a|}\">\\(p^b_a:\\kappa^{|b|}\\to\\kappa^{|a|}\\)</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p^b_a(u)(i)=u((\\operatorname{inc}(b))^{-1}(\\operatorname{inc}(a)(i)))\">\\(p^b_a(u)(i)=u((\\operatorname{inc}(b))^{-1}(\\operatorname{inc}(a)(i)))\\)</span> 确定；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_x=\\{\\langle\\varnothing,x\\rangle\\}\">\\(c_x=\\{\\langle\\varnothing,x\\rangle\\}\\)</span> 是空支撑常函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Extender}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(E)\">\\(\\operatorname{Extender}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(E)\\)</span> 成立时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_E=\\bigcup\\operatorname{dom}(E)\">\\(\\lambda_E=\\bigcup\\operatorname{dom}(E)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_E=\\bigcup\\{\\operatorname{ran}(u):u\\in\\bigcup E(\\{0\\})\\}\">\\(\\kappa_E=\\bigcup\\{\\operatorname{ran}(u):u\\in\\bigcup E(\\{0\\})\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_E^+=\\min\\{\\eta:\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\eta)\\land\\kappa_E&lt;\\eta\\}\">\\(\\kappa_E^+=\\min\\{\\eta:\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\eta)\\land\\kappa_E&lt;\\eta\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ult}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(V,E)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ult}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(V,E)\\)</span> 是下式确定的传递类载体，不是集合结构码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[a,f]_E\">\\([a,f]_E\\)</span> 是 Scott 商代表经唯一成员坍缩所得的元素。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\upharpoonright X\">\\(E\\upharpoonright X\\)</span> 在 extender 支撑位置缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExtRestr}_{58}(E,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{ExtRestr}_{58}(E,X)\\)</span>，不是以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 本身为函数定义域的普通限制。其他函数的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\upharpoonright\">\\(\\upharpoonright\\)</span> 沿用通常集合函数限制。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassFunction}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassFunction}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5578254565969219\" href=\"?note=5578254565969219\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassQuotientCollapse}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassQuotientCollapse}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b1721f50aceb744e\" href=\"?note=b1721f50aceb744e\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-class-quotient-collapse.md\">../batch04/58-df-class-quotient-collapse.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1d8adfba370086ed\" href=\"?note=1d8adfba370086ed\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md\">../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DoddParameter}\">\\(\\mathrm{DoddParameter}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DoddProjectum}\">\\(\\mathrm{DoddProjectum}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExtGenerator}\">\\(\\mathrm{ExtGenerator}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MaxOrdinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{MaxOrdinal}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sc}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sc}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalExtenderCollapse}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalExtenderCollapse}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{class}\">\\(\\mathrm{class}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{meta}\">\\(\\mathrm{meta}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal D_{E,\\kappa,\\lambda}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle a,f\\rangle\\in V:a\\in[\\lambda]^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\kappa^{|a|},\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\},\\\\\n\\langle a,f\\rangle=^{E}_{\\kappa,\\lambda}\\langle b,g\\rangle&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle a,f\\rangle,\\langle b,g\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_{E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\n\\land\\{u\\in\\kappa^{|a\\cup b|}:f(p^{a\\cup b}_a(u))=g(p^{a\\cup b}_b(u))\\}\\in E(a\\cup b),\\\\\n\\langle a,f\\rangle\\in^{E}_{\\kappa,\\lambda}\\langle b,g\\rangle&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle a,f\\rangle,\\langle b,g\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_{E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\n\\land\\{u\\in\\kappa^{|a\\cup b|}:f(p^{a\\cup b}_a(u))\\in g(p^{a\\cup b}_b(u))\\}\\in E(a\\cup b).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal D_{E,\\kappa,\\lambda}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle a,f\\rangle\\in V:a\\in[\\lambda]^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\kappa^{|a|},\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\},\\\\\n\\langle a,f\\rangle=^{E}_{\\kappa,\\lambda}\\langle b,g\\rangle&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle a,f\\rangle,\\langle b,g\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_{E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\n\\land\\{u\\in\\kappa^{|a\\cup b|}:f(p^{a\\cup b}_a(u))=g(p^{a\\cup b}_b(u))\\}\\in E(a\\cup b),\\\\\n\\langle a,f\\rangle\\in^{E}_{\\kappa,\\lambda}\\langle b,g\\rangle&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle a,f\\rangle,\\langle b,g\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_{E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\n\\land\\{u\\in\\kappa^{|a\\cup b|}:f(p^{a\\cup b}_a(u))\\in g(p^{a\\cup b}_b(u))\\}\\in E(a\\cup b).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TotalExtenderCollapse}_{58}(E,\\kappa,\\lambda,N,j,\\pi)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4Extender}_S(E,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ClassQuotientCollapse}_{58}(\\pi,N,\\mathcal D_{E,\\kappa,\\lambda},=^{E}_{\\kappa,\\lambda},\\in^{E}_{\\kappa,\\lambda})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ClassFunction}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,V,N)\n\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;\\bigl(j(x)=\\pi([\\langle\\varnothing,c_x\\rangle]^{\\mathrm{Sc}}_{\\mathcal D_{E,\\kappa,\\lambda},=^{E}_{\\kappa,\\lambda}})\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TotalExtenderCollapse}_{58}(E,\\kappa,\\lambda,N,j,\\pi)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4Extender}_S(E,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ClassQuotientCollapse}_{58}(\\pi,N,\\mathcal D_{E,\\kappa,\\lambda},=^{E}_{\\kappa,\\lambda},\\in^{E}_{\\kappa,\\lambda})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ClassFunction}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,V,N)\n\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;\\bigl(j(x)=\\pi([\\langle\\varnothing,c_x\\rangle]^{\\mathrm{Sc}}_{\\mathcal D_{E,\\kappa,\\lambda},=^{E}_{\\kappa,\\lambda}})\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Extender}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\\;\\exists^{\\mathrm{class}}N,j,\\pi\\;\n\\mathrm{TotalExtenderCollapse}_{58}(E,\\kappa,\\lambda,N,j,\\pi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Extender}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\\;\\exists^{\\mathrm{class}}N,j,\\pi\\;\n\\mathrm{TotalExtenderCollapse}_{58}(E,\\kappa,\\lambda,N,j,\\pi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TotalExtenderCollapse}_{58}(E,\\kappa,\\lambda,N,j,\\pi)\\to{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{Ult}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(V,E)=N\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle a,f\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_{E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\\;\n\\left([a,f]_E=\\pi([\\langle a,f\\rangle]^{\\mathrm{Sc}}_{\\mathcal D_{E,\\kappa,\\lambda},=^{E}_{\\kappa,\\lambda}})\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TotalExtenderCollapse}_{58}(E,\\kappa,\\lambda,N,j,\\pi)\\to{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{Ult}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(V,E)=N\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle a,f\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_{E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\\;\n\\left([a,f]_E=\\pi([\\langle a,f\\rangle]^{\\mathrm{Sc}}_{\\mathcal D_{E,\\kappa,\\lambda},=^{E}_{\\kappa,\\lambda}})\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ExtGenerator}_{58}(\\alpha,E,X)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{Extender}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(E)\\land\\alpha&lt;\\lambda_E\\land X\\subseteq\\lambda_E\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\neg\\exists a\\in[X\\cup\\alpha]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists f\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\kappa_E^{|a|},\\kappa_E)\\land[a,f]_E=\\alpha\\bigr),\\\\\nG_E(X)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\in\\lambda_E:\\kappa_E^+\\leq\\alpha\\land\\mathrm{ExtGenerator}_{58}(\\alpha,E,X)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{MaxOrdinal}_{58}(\\alpha,A)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\alpha\\in A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\\forall\\beta\\in A\\;(\\beta\\leq\\alpha).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ExtGenerator}_{58}(\\alpha,E,X)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{Extender}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(E)\\land\\alpha&lt;\\lambda_E\\land X\\subseteq\\lambda_E\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\neg\\exists a\\in[X\\cup\\alpha]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists f\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\kappa_E^{|a|},\\kappa_E)\\land[a,f]_E=\\alpha\\bigr),\\\\\nG_E(X)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\in\\lambda_E:\\kappa_E^+\\leq\\alpha\\land\\mathrm{ExtGenerator}_{58}(\\alpha,E,X)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{MaxOrdinal}_{58}(\\alpha,A)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\alpha\\in A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\\forall\\beta\\in A\\;(\\beta\\leq\\alpha).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DoddParameter}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(t,E)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{Extender}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(E)\\land\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(t,m,\\lambda_E)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall i&lt;j&lt;m\\;t(j)&lt;t(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall i&lt;m\\;\\mathrm{MaxOrdinal}_{58}(t(i),G_E(\\operatorname{ran}(t\\upharpoonright i))))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\neg\\exists\\alpha\\;\\mathrm{MaxOrdinal}_{58}(\\alpha,G_E(\\operatorname{ran}(t)))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DoddParameter}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(t,E)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{Extender}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(E)\\land\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(t,m,\\lambda_E)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall i&lt;j&lt;m\\;t(j)&lt;t(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall i&lt;m\\;\\mathrm{MaxOrdinal}_{58}(t(i),G_E(\\operatorname{ran}(t\\upharpoonright i))))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\neg\\exists\\alpha\\;\\mathrm{MaxOrdinal}_{58}(\\alpha,G_E(\\operatorname{ran}(t)))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DoddProjectum}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\tau,E,t)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{DoddParameter}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(t,E)\\land\n\\tau=\\sup\\bigl(\\{\\kappa_E^+\\}\\cup\\{\\alpha\\in\\lambda_E:\\mathrm{ExtGenerator}_{58}(\\alpha,E,\\operatorname{ran}(t))\\}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DoddProjectum}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\tau,E,t)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{DoddParameter}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(t,E)\\land\n\\tau=\\sup\\bigl(\\{\\kappa_E^+\\}\\cup\\{\\alpha\\in\\lambda_E:\\mathrm{ExtGenerator}_{58}(\\alpha,E,\\operatorname{ran}(t))\\}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExtRestr}_{58}(E,X)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle a,E(a)\\rangle:a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(E)\\land a\\subseteq X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ExtRestr}_{58}(E,X)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle a,E(a)\\rangle:a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(E)\\land a\\subseteq X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>调用处的底模型明确写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>，因此此处使用 total 短 extender，而不擅自换成某个未给出的 premouse 上的 partial extender。Dodd 参数由最大生成元的逐次选择与不能继续选择的终止条件确定；投射度由生成元上确界确定。源文件最后的无条件全称支撑要求予以保留，并未为了改成文献中常用版本而增加“仅当投射度超过后继基数”的门槛。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<p>Farmer Schlutzenberg, Measures in Mice, arXiv:1301.4702v1, Definitions 2.1, 2.2 and 2.5（用于确定生成元与参数的公式；末项依本书原式保留）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","